ConvomailOAuthTenantMissing = The OAuth app %s has no tenant set in Home - Setup - OAuth.
ConvomailOAuthSetup = Sign in with Google / Microsoft 365
ConvomailOAuthSetupDesc = Users can connect their Google or Microsoft 365 mailbox without a password. Register the app once in <a href="%s">Home - Setup - OAuth</a> (client ID, secret, and the tenant for Microsoft), add the redirect URL below to it, then choose it here. See the README for the steps at Google and Microsoft.
ConvomailOAuthAppFor = OAuth app for %s
ConvomailOAuthNoApp = No app set up in Home - Setup - OAuth
ConvomailOAuthScopesGoogle = Google app: type "Google". Scope requested: https://mail.google.com/ (a restricted scope: an app for users outside your Workspace needs Google's verification).
ConvomailOAuthScopesMicrosoft = Microsoft app: type "Microsoft Exchange Online [SMTP/IMAP]" (or "Microsoft [outlook.office365]"). Delegated permissions: IMAP.AccessAsUser.All, SMTP.Send, offline_access. Authenticated SMTP must be allowed for each mailbox.
ConvomailOAuthRedirectUri = Redirect URL
ConvomailOAuthRedirectUriDesc = Add this exact URL to the app's redirect URIs at Google (Credentials) or Microsoft (App registration - Authentication, platform Web).
ConvomailRecentAddress = Recent correspondent
ConvomailAccountsLoadError = Your mail accounts could not be loaded (%s). An administrator can disable and enable the Convomail module to repair its tables.

